    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "`warning` asks for attention and `destructive` reports an error. Destructive alerts get `role=\"alert\"`, which screen readers announce right away, the others use `role=\"status\"`."
        }
